The Following is a list of ToolTypes for this ICON:


NOTICE: ALL TOOLTYPES ARE CASE SENSITIVE


DRIVE.<num>=


DRIVE.<num>=<drive name>

         -Version 3.0
         -REQUIRED
         -tells /X which drives to use in determining free space for uploads.
         -<num> is nth DRIVE tooltype.

     DRIVE.1=DH1:
     DRIVE.2=DH0:

         -you can have as many of these as you like.

